rtcv-ish is a reimplementation of RTCV (Real-Time Corruptor Vanguard) and
builds on the third-party projects listed below. Thanks to their authors.


** RTCV (Real-Time Corruptor Vanguard) **

URL: https://github.com/redscientistlabs/RTCV
Copyright (c) 2018-2020 Phil Girard & Daniel Barreiro
SPDX: MIT
License: /references/rtcv/LICENSE


** melonDS **

URL: https://github.com/melonDS-emu/melonDS
Copyright 2016-2026 melonDS team (from source headers; the LICENSE file has no project copyright line)
SPDX: GPL-3.0-or-later
License: /emulators/melonds/LICENSE


** melonDS50X-Vanguard **

URL: https://github.com/redscientistlabs/melonDS50X-Vanguard
Copyright 2016-2019 Arisotura (from source headers; the LICENSE file has no project copyright line)
SPDX: GPL-3.0-or-later
License: /references/melonds50x-vanguard/LICENSE


** nds-examples (devkitPro) **

URL: https://github.com/devkitPro/nds-examples
Copyright: none stated
SPDX: NONE
License: none. The repository has no LICENSE file; only individual files carry notices (e.g. Graphics/3D/Picking/source/main.cpp is public domain).


